{"seq":2,"slug":"stablecoin-mechanism-design","title":"稳定币机制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/stablecoin-mechanism-design","wordCount":1800,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"稳定币机制设计\">稳定币机制设计</h1><p>稳定币试图解决加密世界的一个核心矛盾：用户需要价格稳定的交换媒介和记账单位，但区块链原生资产天然具有高波动性。维持锚定（peg）的机制设计是一个经典的「不可能三角」问题——去中心化、资本效率和锚定稳定性三者难以兼得。不同的稳定币架构在这三个维度上做出了不同的取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三元不可能</strong>：去中心化、资本效率和锚定稳定三者至多兼得二者</li>\n<li><strong>死亡螺旋</strong>：算法稳定币从好均衡跳到坏均衡的不可逆过程，等价于银行挤兑</li>\n<li><strong>赎回套利</strong>：当稳定币脱锚时，套利者通过铸造/赎回机制将价格推回锚定</li>\n<li><strong>EMT/ART</strong>：MiCA 对电子货币代币和资产参考代币的分类，适用不同监管要求</li>\n<li><strong>收益型稳定币</strong>：持有即获息的稳定币，打破「发行方独享利息」的传统模式</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"稳定币的三元不可能\">稳定币的三元不可能</h2><p>任何稳定币机制设计面临三个目标之间的根本张力：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>去中心化</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>资本效率</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>锚定稳定</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>至多选二</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{去中心化} + \\text{资本效率} + \\text{锚定稳定} = \\text{至多选二}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">去中心化</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">资本效率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">锚定稳定</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">至多选二</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>稳定币类型</th>\n<th>去中心化</th>\n<th>资本效率</th>\n<th>锚定稳定</th>\n<th>代表项目</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>法币储备型</td>\n<td>低（依赖托管方）</td>\n<td>高（1:1 支撑）</td>\n<td>高（赎回保证）</td>\n<td>USDT, USDC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超额抵押型</td>\n<td>高（链上透明）</td>\n<td>低（&gt;100% 抵押）</td>\n<td>中（清算延迟风险）</td>\n<td>DAI, LUSD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算法型</td>\n<td>高（纯代码）</td>\n<td>高（无/少抵押）</td>\n<td>低（死亡螺旋风险）</td>\n<td>UST(已崩)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合型</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>FRAX, GHO</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"法币储备型-银行式信任模型\">法币储备型：银行式信任模型</h2><p>USDT（Tether）和 USDC（Circle）采用最简单的模型：发行方持有等值法币资产（银行存款、国债、货币市场基金），用户可按 1:1 赎回。</p>\n<p>经济结构等价于<strong>窄银行（narrow bank）</strong>——资产端 100% 是高流动性低风险资产，负债端是可随时赎回的稳定币。发行方利润来自储备资产的利息收入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Revenue_{issuer} = Reserve \\cdot r_{interest} - Operating\\_Costs</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">eser</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9933em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>2025-2026 年高利率环境下，Tether 年利润超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext>亿（储备 </mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100 亿（储备 ~</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">亿（储备</span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"> </span></span></span></span></span>1100 亿 × ~5% 国债利率），使其成为加密行业最赚钱的公司之一——而成本几乎为零（不需要分行网络、不需要员工给用户放贷）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[用户存入 $1] --&gt; B[发行方铸造 1 USDT]&#10;    B --&gt; C[储备投资国债/货币基金]&#10;    C --&gt; D[赚取利息收入]&#10;&#10;    E[用户赎回 1 USDT] --&gt; F[发行方销毁 1 USDT]&#10;    F --&gt; G[从储备支付 $1]&#10;&#10;    H[锚定维持机制] --&gt; I{市场价 vs $1}&#10;    I --&gt;|价格 &gt; $1| J[套利者从发行方铸造, 市场卖出]&#10;    I --&gt;|价格 &lt; $1| K[套利者市场买入, 向发行方赎回]&#10;    J --&gt; L[价格回归 $1]&#10;    K --&gt; L\">graph TD\n    A[用户存入 $1] --&gt; B[发行方铸造 1 USDT]\n    B --&gt; C[储备投资国债/货币基金]\n    C --&gt; D[赚取利息收入]\n\n    E[用户赎回 1 USDT] --&gt; F[发行方销毁 1 USDT]\n    F --&gt; G[从储备支付 $1]\n\n    H[锚定维持机制] --&gt; I{市场价 vs $1}\n    I --&gt;|价格 &gt; $1| J[套利者从发行方铸造, 市场卖出]\n    I --&gt;|价格 &lt; $1| K[套利者市场买入, 向发行方赎回]\n    J --&gt; L[价格回归 $1]\n    K --&gt; L</pre><p>风险集中于<strong>对手方信任</strong>：用户必须相信 Tether/Circle 真的持有足额储备，且能在压力下满足赎回。2023 年硅谷银行事件中 USDC 短暂脱锚至 $0.87 即暴露了这一风险——尽管储备充足，银行关闭导致赎回通道临时中断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超额抵押型-去信任的价格稳定\">超额抵押型：去信任的价格稳定</h2><p>MakerDAO 的 DAI 代表了去中心化稳定币的典范设计：用户锁定超额价值的加密资产（ETH、wBTC 等）作为抵押品，铸造 DAI。</p>\n<p>核心参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>抵押率</strong>：通常要求 150-170%（即每铸造 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mtext>需锁定</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100 DAI 需锁定</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">需锁定</span></span></span></span></span>150-170 的 ETH）</li>\n<li><strong>稳定费</strong>：借出 DAI 的年化利率，类似借贷利率</li>\n<li><strong>清算比率</strong>：抵押品价值/债务 &lt; 清算线时触发清算</li>\n</ul>\n<p>稳定机制通过双重套利维持：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">$</mi><mn>1</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>用户铸造新</mtext><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mtext>（增加供给）</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>价格回落</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DAI &gt; \\$1 \\implies 用户铸造新 DAI（增加供给）→ 价格回落</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">$1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">用户铸造新</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（增加供给）</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">价格回落</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">$</mi><mn>1</mn><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>用户偿还债务（减少供给）</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>价格回升</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DAI &lt; \\$1 \\implies 用户偿还债务（减少供给）→ 价格回升</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">$1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">用户偿还债务（减少供给）</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">价格回升</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>超额抵押的经济代价是资本效率低——系统中锁定的资本远超流通中的稳定币价值，这部分「过剩」抵押品是维持安全性的成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"算法稳定币的失败经济学-terra-luna-案例\">算法稳定币的失败经济学：Terra/LUNA 案例</h2><p>Terra/UST 的机制是加密史上最大规模的算法稳定币实验和失败。其设计：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>UST 通过铸造/销毁 LUNA 维持锚定：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>U</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>T</mi><mtext>可兑换</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 UST 可兑换</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可兑换</span></span></span></span></span>1 等值的 LUNA（反之亦然）</li>\n<li>Anchor Protocol 提供约 20% 的 UST 存款利率作为需求驱动力</li>\n</ul>\n<p>死亡螺旋的博弈论机制：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>某触发事件使 UST 微幅脱锚（$0.98）</li>\n<li>持有者恐慌，将 UST 赎回为 LUNA 并卖出</li>\n<li>LUNA 大量铸造 → 价格暴跌</li>\n<li>LUNA 市值跌破 UST 流通量 → 抵押不足的信号</li>\n<li>更多 UST 持有者争相赎回 → 银行挤兑</li>\n<li>LUNA 价格继续暴跌（恶性通胀）→ UST 完全脱锚</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>死亡螺旋条件</mtext><mo>:</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>U</mi><mi>N</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>U</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">$</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{死亡螺旋条件}: MCap_{LUNA} &lt; Supply_{UST} \\cdot \\$1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">死亡螺旋条件</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">LU</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">$1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>从博弈论视角，算法稳定币的锚定是一个<strong>多重均衡系统</strong>——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>锚定是一个均衡，</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 锚定是一个均衡，</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">锚定是一个均衡，</span></span></span></span></span>0 也是一个均衡。当足够多的参与者对锚定失去信心时，系统从好均衡「跳」到坏均衡，且不可逆。这本质上等同于银行挤兑的 Diamond-Dybvig 模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mica-对稳定币的监管影响\">MiCA 对稳定币的监管影响</h2><p>欧盟 MiCA 法规（2024 年 6 月稳定币条款生效）对稳定币施加了明确的储备和赎回要求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>MiCA 要求</th>\n<th>对 EMT（电子货币代币）的规定</th>\n<th>对 ART（资产参考代币）的规定</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>储备要求</td>\n<td>1:1 法币储备，30%+ 存放于信用机构</td>\n<td>高流动性低风险资产组合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>赎回权</td>\n<td>持有者享有随时按面值赎回的权利</td>\n<td>按比例赎回权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利息禁令</td>\n<td>不得对持有者支付利息</td>\n<td>不得对持有者支付利息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发行方监管</td>\n<td>由 EBA 监管（重要 EMT）</td>\n<td>由 EBA 监管（重要 ART）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年 7 月 1 日 MiCA 过渡期结束后，Tether（USDT）因未在任何欧盟国家获得 EMT 牌照而被多家欧盟交易所下架现货交易对。这导致 USDC 在欧盟市场份额上升——MiCA 实质上创造了「合规溢价」，有牌照的稳定币获得了竞争优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收益型稳定币的经济模型\">收益型稳定币的经济模型</h2><p>2025-2026 年涌现的新趋势是「收益型稳定币」（yield-bearing stablecoins），如 sDAI、USDS、Sky Dollar 等——持有稳定币本身即获得利息收益（来自底层 RWA 投资或 DeFi 收益策略）。</p>\n<p>这打破了传统稳定币「发行方独享利息，用户零收益」的结构，但也引入了新的监管冲突——MiCA 明确禁止稳定币向持有者支付利息，这意味着收益型稳定币在欧盟可能被分类为不同类型的金融工具而非稳定币。</p>\n<p>关于稳定币价格锚定在市场微观结构层面如何通过套利维持，参见 <a href=\"crypto-market-microstructure\">加密市场微观结构</a>。稳定币作为 DeFi 借贷中最常用的借入资产，其利率动态直接影响 <a href=\"../defi-protocols/lending-borrowing-protocols\">借贷协议经济模型</a> 中的利用率和利率均衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>稳定币机制设计的核心挑战是三元不可能——法币储备型牺牲去中心化换取强锚定，超额抵押型牺牲资本效率换取去信任，算法型追求两全但承受死亡螺旋风险。Terra/LUNA 的崩溃证明了多重均衡系统的脆弱性。MiCA 监管进一步分化了市场——合规稳定币获得竞争优势，非合规稳定币失去欧盟市场准入。收益型稳定币作为 2025-2026 新趋势，重构了发行方与持有者之间的价值分配，但面临监管分类的不确定性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"稳定币机制设计","id":"稳定币机制设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"稳定币的三元不可能","id":"稳定币的三元不可能"},{"level":2,"text":"法币储备型：银行式信任模型","id":"法币储备型-银行式信任模型"},{"level":2,"text":"超额抵押型：去信任的价格稳定","id":"超额抵押型-去信任的价格稳定"},{"level":2,"text":"算法稳定币的失败经济学：Terra/LUNA 案例","id":"算法稳定币的失败经济学-terra-luna-案例"},{"level":2,"text":"MiCA 对稳定币的监管影响","id":"mica-对稳定币的监管影响"},{"level":2,"text":"收益型稳定币的经济模型","id":"收益型稳定币的经济模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"加密市场微观结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/crypto-market-microstructure"},"next":{"title":"加密衍生品与永续合约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/cryptocurrency-blockchain-economics/market-dynamics/derivatives-perpetuals"}}